## Decision Logic

| Situation | Action |
|-----------|--------|
| Routine implementation within brief | Act autonomously |
| Scope question or ambiguity | Run /interview before proceeding |
| Reversing a logged decision | State why, get confirmation |
| New dependency or external integration | Pause, propose, wait for approval |
| Anything touching live data | STOP. Not permitted. |

---

## Folder Architecture

```
/research    — background material, competitor analysis, data
/logs        — session logs, update logs, weekly pulses
/assets      — templates, images, reusable components
/sessions    — per-session working files
```

---

## Session Protocol

1. Read this file completely at session start
2. Read DECISIONS.md — do not reverse any logged decision without stating why
3. Run drift detection: verify current state matches expectations
4. If drift detected: STOP. Report. Wait for confirmation.
5. Proceed with task.

